{"id": "val-en-joy-01", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the bus was late but a stranger held the door for me and I grinned the whole way"}
{"id": "val-en-joy-02", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "my little cousin learned to whistle today and now she will not stop"}
{"id": "val-en-joy-03", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "we finished the presentation early and went for ice cream together"}
{"id": "val-en-joy-04", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the first tomato from my balcony plant actually tasted sweet"}
{"id": "val-en-joy-05", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "an old flatmate sent a photo of our old kitchen and I laughed out loud"}
{"id": "val-en-joy-06", "labels": ["joy"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "after weeks of practice I finally swam a full lap without stopping"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-01", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the festival was cancelled and the whole street felt empty"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-02", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I found my grandmother's handwriting in an old notebook and had to sit down"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-03", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "my flight was rescheduled and I spent my birthday in an airport"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-04", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I watered the plant too much and now it is gone"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-05", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the teacher marked my essay and wrote only one word on it"}
{"id": "val-en-sadness-06", "labels": ["sadness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I did not get the internship I had prepared for all year"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-01", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the shop closed early and the sign still said open till nine"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-02", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "someone threw a cup out of the bus window right in front of me"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-03", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "my landlord let himself into my room again without telling me"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-04", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the app charged me twice and support keeps sending the same template"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-05", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the driver took a longer route and still asked for extra"}
{"id": "val-en-anger-06", "labels": ["anger"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "they moved the exam three days before the paper"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-01", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "there was a loud crack from the ceiling and I did not move for a minute"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-02", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the dog on the corner started running at me and my legs went cold"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-03", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the lift stopped between two floors and the light flickered"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-04", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I heard glass break next door and everyone went quiet"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-05", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the clinic called and asked me to come in earlier than planned"}
{"id": "val-en-fear-06", "labels": ["fear"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the bike skidded on the wet road and my hands shook afterwards"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-01", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the interview is on Monday and I keep rehearsing answers in the shower"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-02", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I have not heard back about the loan and I check my phone every ten minutes"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-03", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the report is not out yet and my mind keeps going to the worst version"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-04", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the results come out tomorrow and my stomach feels tight"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-05", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I have to speak in front of fifty people next week and I keep waking up early"}
{"id": "val-en-anxiety-06", "labels": ["anxiety"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "one stamp is still missing on the form and the deadline is Friday"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-01", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I snapped at my mother and could not look at her at dinner"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-02", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I forgot the words on stage and everyone was watching"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-03", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I told everyone the work was finished and now I have to admit it is not"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-04", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I was short with the waiter and the whole table went quiet"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-05", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "my marks came back and I hid the paper from my parents"}
{"id": "val-en-shame-06", "labels": ["shame"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I borrowed money and have not been able to return it for months"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-01", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the group chat is busy all day but nobody replies to me"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-02", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I moved to a new city and know nobody on this street"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-03", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I ate dinner alone again and the kitchen felt very big"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-04", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "my friends made plans in front of me and did not invite me"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-05", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "it is my birthday and only the bank sent a message"}
{"id": "val-en-loneliness-06", "labels": ["loneliness"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I have a lot to say but there is nobody to call at this hour"}
{"id": "val-en-calm-01", "labels": ["calm"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "rain on the window and a cup of tea, nothing to do today"}
{"id": "val-en-calm-02", "labels": ["calm"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "I walked slowly by the lake and did not check the time once"}
{"id": "val-en-calm-03", "labels": ["calm"], "lang": "en", "licence": "MIT (this repository)", "source": "handwritten-val-v1", "text": "the house is quiet now and everything I needed to do is done"}
